	"system": {
		"description": "<p>When you use one of your @UUID[Compendium.a5e.a5e-class-features.Item.Pl7PYMUxQS7LlokG]{Pollinator’s Dance} features, a pair of wings that correspond to the pollinator you are calling upon sprouts from your back. You gain a fly speed equal to your Speed in addition to the benefits the specific dance grants. These wings persist for a number of rounds equal to your Wisdom modifier.</p><p>If you are still airborne when this feature ends, you are reduced to 0 hit points, or you are incapacitated, you fall at a rate of 30 feet per round.</p>",
